{"h":3396,"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.098765432113622348,"t":"Test 3","y":0.036219081039740697,"w":0.061728394826253252,"h":0.013250883392226243,"c":1},{"w":0.69753087361653654,"c":1,"h":0.017667844522968101,"t":"At the edges of the contracting ice patches, archaeologists found more than 2,000","x":0.14197530419523521,"y":0.081272084859176363},{"t":"artefacts, which formed a material record that ran from 4,000 BCE to the beginnings of the","y":0.096686460984704903,"h":0.022383036124832612,"c":1,"w":0.78012079874674467,"x":0.14387739346837872},{"y":0.11589628453353717,"h":0.020426802977796754,"x":0.14393450868778815,"t":"Renaissance in the 14th century. Many of the artefacts are associated with hunting. Hunters","w":0.78209635416666667,"c":1},{"y":0.13515901083301907,"t":"would have easily misplaced arrows and they often discarded broken bows rather than take","x":0.14609052705543016,"h":0.016003780005536927,"w":0.77366256713867188,"c":1},{"w":0.75321716308593756,"t":"them all the way home. Other items could have been used by hunters traversing the high","x":0.14397252321816714,"h":0.018984863137468722,"y":0.15141668315590862,"c":1},{"w":0.67489710489908861,"c":1,"h":0.017667844522968101,"t":"mountain passes of Oppland: all-purpose items like tools, skis, and horse tack.","x":0.14403292893853697,"y":0.17137809200043042},{"c":1,"w":0.7921810913085936,"x":0.14403291130937276,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"Barrett's team radiocarbon-dated 153 of the artefacts and compared those dates to the timing","y":0.19758539480889359},{"h":0.018963828384525261,"x":0.14403292128664533,"y":0.21366279108034769,"c":1,"w":0.78189300537109374,"t":"of major environmental changes in the region - such as periods of cooling or warming - and"},{"t":"major social and economic shifts - such as the growth of farming settlements and the spread","h":0.01940293755772815,"w":0.78204854329427076,"c":1,"y":0.23253143979471136,"x":0.14396012840991385},{"h":0.020515086934479454,"y":0.24983355963357856,"x":0.14393899126697249,"w":0.77180318196614583,"c":1,"t":"of international trade networks leading up to the Viking Age. They found that some periods"},{"w":0.73674240112304679,"y":0.26878217746459621,"x":0.14398190059484031,"t":"had produced lots of artefacts, which indicates that people had been pretty active in the","c":1,"h":0.019578986510511598},{"c":1,"w":0.79437347412109371,"x":0.14396127467489955,"t":"mountains during those times. But there were few or no signs of activity during other periods.","y":0.28584323819686075,"h":0.019808631061243864},{"x":0.14602410050632586,"y":0.31361439857064854,"c":1,"t":"What was surprising, according to Barrett, was the timing of these periods. Oppland's","h":0.019773330508749964,"w":0.73266148885091154},{"w":0.78003789265950507,"x":0.14393321070606219,"t":"mountains present daunting terrain and in periods of extreme cold, glaciers could block the","c":1,"h":0.020520486595773879,"y":0.33076768469391016},{"w":0.76142583211263015,"y":0.34928680417625246,"t":"higher mountain passes and make travel in the upper reaches of the mountains extremely","x":0.14398045864778947,"h":0.018830281404780713,"c":1},{"w":0.73674514770507815,"y":0.36732628693300751,"t":"difficult. Archaeologists assumed people would stick to lower elevations during a time","c":1,"h":0.018603481027627877,"x":0.14602420161603541},{"c":1,"t":"like the Late Antique Little Ice Age, a short period of deeper-than-usual cold from about","y":0.38259583061254387,"w":0.75959192911783857,"x":0.14390652569089715,"h":0.023738888042975637},{"y":0.40253239094672089,"t":"536-600 CE. But it turned out that hunters kept regularly venturing into the mountains","c":1,"h":0.017667844522968101,"x":0.14609053204192776,"w":0.74279836018880208},{"h":0.016195524146054296,"t":"even when the climate turned cold, based on the amount of stuff they had apparently","y":0.42137809201256871,"w":0.72016459147135414,"c":1,"x":0.14609054373436209},{"w":0.1299258550008138,"y":0.43978418456509205,"t":"dropped there.","x":0.14594242210881561,"h":0.017233955846096771,"c":1},{"w":0.7202997843424479,"h":0.019900457878696876,"c":1,"t":"'Remarkably, though, the finds from the ice may have continued through this period,","x":0.146030560087965,"y":0.47317717060040509},{"w":0.73072896321614578,"c":1,"y":0.49018659012649546,"h":0.021186552283620652,"t":"perhaps suggesting that the importance of mountain hunting increased to supplement","x":0.14593792788133222},{"c":1,"x":0.14599735353738291,"t":"failing agricultural harvests in times of low temperatures,' says Barrett. A colder turn in the","y":0.50850696465084599,"w":0.78208287556966138,"h":0.019763840943820665},{"y":0.52761627890743878,"w":0.75308639526367183,"x":0.14814816042319204,"h":0.017441860778592888,"t":"Scandinavian climate would likely have meant widespread crop failures, so more people","c":1},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"t":"would have depended on hunting to make up for those losses.","y":0.54651162775885875,"x":0.14814815245566404,"w":0.5267489624023437},{"t":"Many of the artefacts Barrett's team recovered date from the beginning of the Viking Age,","h":0.018048084807199438,"x":0.1480936140253156,"c":1,"y":0.57216783738615007,"w":0.76963714599609367},{"c":1,"x":0.14594654302538024,"t":"the 700s through to the 900s CE. Trade networks connecting Scandinavia with Europe and","w":0.77606302897135415,"y":0.58749752004776301,"h":0.023686362941638617},{"y":0.6089517080299125,"h":0.016048292108362783,"w":0.78189300537109385,"t":"the Middle East were expanding around this time. Although we usually think of ships when","c":1,"x":0.14609053439597905},{"w":0.74916473388671878,"x":0.14805142245003991,"c":1,"h":0.019802590000615461,"t":"we think of Scandinavian expansion, these recent discoveries show that plenty of goods","y":0.62527696883113182},{"x":0.14803962568350321,"y":0.64231157229049263,"w":0.78415074666341145,"h":0.021514652193786121,"c":1,"t":"travelled on overland routes, like the mountain passes of Oppland. And growing Norwegian"},{"w":0.78208394368489587,"y":0.6606139906177807,"c":1,"x":0.14599596448460136,"t":"towns, along with export markets, would have created a booming demand for hides to fight","h":0.020603546124605465},{"h":0.016008916255020766,"c":1,"y":0.68021201411659327,"w":0.76337448120117191,"t":"off the cold, as well as antlers to make useful things like combs. Business must have been","x":0.14814815034175335},{"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"good for hunters.","x":0.14814814808585586,"y":0.69905771512568482,"w":0.15226337432861325},{"t":"Norway's mountains are probably still hiding a lot of history - and prehistory - in remote","x":0.14814815847848403,"c":1,"y":0.72526501738856908,"w":0.76543207804361979,"h":0.017467540902720735},{"t":"ice patches. When Barrett's team looked at the dates for their sample of 153 artefacts,","c":1,"y":0.74263839808371657,"w":0.73662551879882809,"x":0.14609053278693182,"h":0.017667844522968101},{"x":0.14814814958948205,"c":1,"y":0.76017441842066003,"t":"they noticed a gap with almost no artefacts from about 3,800 to 2,200 BCE. In fact,","w":0.71810699462890626,"h":0.01750520486011653},{"y":0.77906976729516697,"x":0.14814815309863075,"c":1,"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"archaeological finds from that period are rare all over Norway. The researchers say that","w":0.74485595703125007},{"t":"could be because many of those artefacts have already disintegrated or are still frozen in the","h":0.019350693279216902,"y":0.79530410404266649,"w":0.78823476155598959,"x":0.14806703373084892,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"ice. That means archaeologists could be extracting some of those artefacts from retreating","y":0.81389870417091081,"w":0.76954732259114578,"h":0.017496644818740692,"x":0.14814814932900891},{"w":0.18186846415201821,"t":"ice in years to come.","h":0.017989611316766241,"c":1,"y":0.83349328550959212,"x":0.14976827482224811},{"w":0.026748971939086902,"x":0.1028806579604977,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"66","y":0.90843023238112497},{"y":0.9556315263824986,"w":0.25431531270345054,"h":0.028414039926338064,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.7194745805284799}]}